<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Hardened runtime, no App Sandbox, and deliberately NO exceptions: the app is distributed with Developer ID, not
     through the Mac App Store. librdkafka and OpenSSL are linked statically (no dlopen, no JIT, no unsigned libraries),
     the network client needs no entitlement outside a sandbox, and the Keychain items live in the legacy login
     keychain. See docs/development.md ("Đóng gói"). Add keys here only with a reason written next to them. -->
